# activities-only-standalone — a shared disposition library used with NO decision library
library "Dispositions".

// Used with NO decision library in the closure. Suppression is keyed on exactly-one
// decision-bearing sibling; with zero, the library is NOT suppressed (unchanged
// pre-#186 behavior) — no rebind is recorded.

activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.
